WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.200
The Scarlet King is a really bad guy.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.419
He’s a giant, interdimensional Nightmare
God, intent on breaching our reality and wreaking

00:00:08.419 --> 00:00:12.110
terrible havoc on everything we know and love.

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:17.109
He’s been responsible for untold suffering
and chaos across countless worlds, timelines,

00:00:17.109 --> 00:00:19.170
and layers of reality.

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:23.980
To many, he’s even somewhat of a “Final
Boss” to the SCP Foundation.

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:28.730
And just when you think he couldn’t get
any worse, it turns out that he’s also a

00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:30.160
deadbeat dad.

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:34.380
Not only did the Scarlet King once have a
cult literally named The Children of the Scarlet

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:40.020
King, before it was destroyed by Dr. Montauk
and the SCP Foundation, he also had at least

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:42.260
seven actual children.

00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:46.500
Each one is speculated to be a powerful anomaly,
but it’s tough to find concrete answers

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:49.840
as to who, or what exactly, most of them are.

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:53.960
So today we’re putting on our researcher
hats and digging deep into the Foundation

00:00:53.960 --> 00:01:00.030
lore, to present our theories on the potential
progeny of the SCP Foundation’s greatest

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:01.030
enemy.

00:01:01.030 --> 00:01:05.510
And if nothing else, we might finally be able
to get this dark lord of all evil to start

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:08.370
paying all the child support he probably owes
by now.

00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:13.160
First, if you’re not well-versed in Scarlet
King lore, you may be wondering: How exactly

00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:15.810
does an Evil Chaos God have kids?

00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:19.730
Is there a Scarlet Queen out there who prefers
to stay out of the limelight?

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:25.850
The answer isn’t quite that simple, and
it has everything to do with SCP-231 and Big

00:01:25.850 --> 00:01:30.890
Red’s most devoted cult, the non-biological
Children of the Scarlet King.

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:35.830
They kidnapped a group of seven girls, and
performed a number of dark rituals that resulted

00:01:35.830 --> 00:01:40.820
in them becoming vessels for the Scarlet King’s
Seven Terrible Kids.

00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:45.299
These seven girls have become known as SCP-231.

00:01:45.299 --> 00:01:49.720
Anyone who accesses those files - and trust
us, that they aren’t a pretty sight - will

00:01:49.720 --> 00:01:54.400
find that containment procedures mostly involved
performing the infamous Montauk Procedure

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:57.869
on the surviving girls to keep them from giving
birth.

00:01:57.869 --> 00:02:02.580
Six of the seven brides have given birth to
nightmares beyond comprehension and are now

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:06.910
dead, with only one still remaining successfully
contained.

00:02:06.910 --> 00:02:12.489
But here at the SCP Foundation, you need to
learn to comprehend the incomprehensible.

00:02:12.489 --> 00:02:18.120
According to a classified document, SCP-231
may technically be a neutralized anomaly without

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:19.480
us even knowing.

00:02:19.480 --> 00:02:24.690
And incidentally, this gives us our most certain
answer on the Children of the Scarlet King.

00:02:24.690 --> 00:02:29.230
On this one, the apple fell very, very far
from the tree.

00:02:29.230 --> 00:02:34.659
According to the secret document, SCP-999
- that’s right, the adorable tickle monster

00:02:34.659 --> 00:02:37.909
- is the seventh child of the Scarlet King.

00:02:37.909 --> 00:02:41.659
He must be so disappointed that everyone’s
favorite little blob didn’t want to join

00:02:41.659 --> 00:02:43.969
the family business of Absolute Evil.

00:02:43.969 --> 00:02:49.709
For anyone who doesn’t know, SCP-999 is
a slimy, yellow entity that only seems capable

00:02:49.709 --> 00:02:51.579
of absolute compassion.

00:02:51.579 --> 00:02:56.569
It brings joy to everyone in its presence,
and with prolonged exposure, it can even cure

00:02:56.569 --> 00:02:59.980
disorders like PTSD, anxiety, and depression.

00:02:59.980 --> 00:03:07.389
He’s so good at this that he even cured
SCP-231-7 - his de facto mother - of her trauma,

00:03:07.389 --> 00:03:11.749
and allowed her to return happily to her family
after some amnestic treatment.

00:03:11.749 --> 00:03:16.590
The Scarlet King has another good reason to
be ashamed of his cheerful, blobby son: Ancient

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:22.419
Daevite prophecy dictates that SCP-999 may
someday become so powerful that his force

00:03:22.419 --> 00:03:27.569
of absolute love and good overwhelms the Scarlet
King’s evil and chaos.

00:03:27.569 --> 00:03:32.329
Think of him as the Luke Skywalker to the
Scarlet King’s Darth Vader, though we probably

00:03:32.329 --> 00:03:35.790
can’t expect a cool lightsaber battle between
them any time soon.

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:37.099
How disappointing.

00:03:37.099 --> 00:03:42.440
So if SCP-999 is the quiet, sensitive, black
sheep of the Scarlet Family, who’s the golden

00:03:42.440 --> 00:03:45.059
child who makes his evil father proud?

00:03:45.059 --> 00:03:47.529
The real chip off the old block?

00:03:47.529 --> 00:03:54.379
That would be our dear, reptilian friend SCP-682,
the malicious lizard heavily implied to be

00:03:54.379 --> 00:03:56.559
a child of the Scarlet King.

00:03:56.559 --> 00:04:00.839
If you know literally anything about 682,
your reaction to finding out he’s the spawn

00:04:00.839 --> 00:04:04.389
of cruelty personified is probably, “Yeah,
that makes sense.”

00:04:04.389 --> 00:04:11.150
Just as SCP-999 is the Scarlet King’s innocent,
optimistic young child, 682 is kind of like

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:16.260
his edgy teenager, still in the middle of
a misanthropic phase he shows no sign of leaving

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:18.019
anytime soon.

00:04:18.019 --> 00:04:22.530
The fact that 682 appears to find everything
about the world around him utterly disgusting

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:27.419
seems to be a trait he inherited from his
dear old Dad, and the fact he seems pretty

00:04:27.419 --> 00:04:31.990
much impossible to kill also lends credence
to the popular theory he’s got Nightmare

00:04:31.990 --> 00:04:34.509
God Blood running through his veins.

00:04:34.509 --> 00:04:40.889
682 has also started displaying a particular
hatred for 999 ever since an incident where

00:04:40.889 --> 00:04:46.260
999 tickled him into submission, so family
dinners are probably extra awkward for these

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:47.260
two.

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:52.699
999 and 682 are the most certain children,
but that still leaves us with five more children

00:04:52.699 --> 00:04:53.699
to identify.

00:04:53.699 --> 00:04:58.080
It’s worth remembering that the waters are
murkier from here on in, but we’ve searched

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:02.240
far and wide through the Foundation Archives
to find possible answers.

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:09.250
If your interpretation differs, remember that
it’s just a theory - an SCP Explained Theory.

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:14.449
Thankfully, we do have some assistance here:
The tale Dust and Blood hinted at what each

00:05:14.449 --> 00:05:19.210
of the seven children of the Scarlet King
represents, and that may help us narrow down

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:20.490
our choices here.

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:26.060
To put things into perspective, it’s believed
that 682 was the fourth child to be born,

00:05:26.060 --> 00:05:27.110
representing Wrath.

00:05:27.110 --> 00:05:30.759
And 999 was the seventh, representing Hope.

00:05:30.759 --> 00:05:36.220
According to this tale, the first of the seven
children represents Dominion, and as a result,

00:05:36.220 --> 00:05:41.530
is skilled in the ways of war and has the
power to lead the King’s forces to victory.

00:05:41.530 --> 00:05:47.480
According to one Foundation theorist, this
child could potentially be SCP-239, also known

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:49.199
as the Witch Child.

00:05:49.199 --> 00:05:54.130
This entity is so powerful that, as part of
its containment procedures, it’s eternally

00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:55.830
kept in a coma.

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:56.830
Why?

00:05:56.830 --> 00:06:02.500
Because this seemingly normal child has dominion
over reality, and can change it to her whims.

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:07.081
Her thoughts are so powerful that just her
brain waves can damage physical matter, and

00:06:07.081 --> 00:06:10.509
she can make things disappear or manifest
in an instant.

00:06:10.509 --> 00:06:15.389
She’s also almost impossible to kill, with
skin that’s almost totally impenetrable.

00:06:15.389 --> 00:06:21.560
Much like SCP-682, she’s also frighteningly
strong in both the offense and defense department.

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:27.419
We’re talking about such a powerful telepath
that Dr. Clef has campaigned for her immediate

00:06:27.419 --> 00:06:30.759
termination, just because it’s safer that
way.

00:06:30.759 --> 00:06:35.150
This is certainly a frightening wunderkind
that the Scarlet King would be proud to call

00:06:35.150 --> 00:06:36.180
his daughter.

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:37.979
Next, the second child.

00:06:37.979 --> 00:06:41.530
According to the prophecy, this child represents
“Longing.”

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:46.569
The child has the power to bring forth armies,
which will help the Scarlet King in his conquest.

00:06:46.569 --> 00:06:52.840
For this, we actually have a pretty unconventional
theory: SCP-029, otherwise known as the Daughter

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:54.210
of Darkness.

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:58.729
If the name alone wasn’t enough to suggest
that she’s got an extremely sinister father,

00:06:58.729 --> 00:07:03.629
she also fits the profile of being very aggressive
and incredibly hard to kill.

00:07:03.629 --> 00:07:07.570
But even more damning is her connections to
the symbology of “Longing”: One of her

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:13.490
most dangerous powers is causing men to fall
into almost trancelike devotion to her.

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:18.189
After spending time around her, they’re
suddenly willing to murder in her honor - strangling

00:07:18.189 --> 00:07:23.970
their victims in hopes of raising Kali, the
Hindu god of destruction, whom has many similarities

00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:25.639
to the Scarlet King.

00:07:25.639 --> 00:07:30.630
She certainly fits the bill of someone capable
of raising armies in the dark lord’s name.

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:34.810
One strike against our Scarlet King connection
theory is that the file states the Daughter

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:39.880
of Darkness was first discovered in India,
which wouldn’t match up with the other information

00:07:39.880 --> 00:07:41.720
we know to be fact.

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:45.960
However, while this is a long shot, given
the sensitive nature of everything involving

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:50.740
the Scarlet King, it’s extremely possible
that false information was supplied to bury

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:52.020
the connection.

00:07:52.020 --> 00:07:57.830
Considering the coverups and lies involving
anomalies like SCP-1000, this certainly isn’t

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:00.930
an unprecedented move on the part of the Foundation.

00:08:00.930 --> 00:08:03.189
Next, the third child.

00:08:03.189 --> 00:08:10.009
This child is associated with all things “Desolation”,
implying destruction, fire, ashes, pestilence,

00:08:10.009 --> 00:08:12.270
and death across the battlefield.

00:08:12.270 --> 00:08:17.050
When it comes to spreading destruction and
death on a mass scale, one particular SCP

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:23.139
comes to mind: SCP-058, the Heart of Darkness.

00:08:23.139 --> 00:08:28.990
This creature has Scarlet King written all
over it: It’s evil, it’s mysterious, it’s

00:08:28.990 --> 00:08:33.730
pretty much impossible to kill, and it causes
mass casualties every time it escapes its

00:08:33.730 --> 00:08:34.960
containment chamber.

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:40.440
It causes fires, whips people to death with
its razor-sharp tendrils, and sprays highly

00:08:40.440 --> 00:08:43.290
corrosive acid from its scorpion-like tail.

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:45.400
And it’s even red!

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:49.910
Given that we know for a fact this entity
suddenly emerged out of something that’s

00:08:49.910 --> 00:08:55.150
now been expunged from the records in an undisclosed
site, it’s extremely possible that the entity

00:08:55.150 --> 00:08:59.840
058 came from was SCP-231-3.

00:08:59.840 --> 00:09:04.220
This is a child that the Scarlet King would
definitely be proud of, given that it’s

00:09:04.220 --> 00:09:09.660
impossible to reason with, and feels solely
motivated by causing destruction, misery,

00:09:09.660 --> 00:09:10.890
and chaos.

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:17.060
We can’t think of any entity that better
suits the “Desolation” moniker than SCP-058.

00:09:17.060 --> 00:09:23.320
Next - skipping past SCP-682 at number four
- the fifth child of the Scarlet King is associated

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:25.840
with the loose concept of “Lack.”

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:30.690
The prophecy then goes into more detail, saying
that this child is powerful in the ways of

00:09:30.690 --> 00:09:34.590
magic, and is able to use their abilities
to cause great destruction.

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:39.960
Here, we have another unconventional proposal:
What if child number four wasn’t actually

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:42.240
a child, but children?

00:09:42.240 --> 00:09:48.620
That’s because we think this description
perfectly fits SCP-1765, the nightmarish,

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:54.750
reality warping Sisters, who we think may
actually be triplets of the Scarlet King’s

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:56.100
fifth bride.

00:09:56.100 --> 00:10:00.340
Hear us out: These are actually some of the
most powerful enemies the Foundation has ever

00:10:00.340 --> 00:10:05.130
attempted to contain, and we know nothing
about their past before being bound to a few

00:10:05.130 --> 00:10:07.620
objects by the Serpent’s Hand.

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:12.650
These sadistic reality warpers are so devastatingly
powerful that the only action the Foundation

00:10:12.650 --> 00:10:16.720
can take against them is letting them have
free reign over the containment site they

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:18.280
currently inhabit.

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:23.660
All the Foundation can do is hope they never
get bored of tormenting the people inside.

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:29.040
As we all know, the Scarlet King despises
science, progress, and order, so perhaps a

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:33.660
perfect punishment for the Foundation in his
many eyes is giving them a taste of their

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:35.180
own medicine.

00:10:35.180 --> 00:10:40.230
The Sisters, though particularly their ringleader,
are a perverse shadow of the Foundation’s

00:10:40.230 --> 00:10:42.530
love of the scientific method.

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:46.930
They take these methods and use them for an
activity that the Scarlet King finds much

00:10:46.930 --> 00:10:51.230
more enjoyable: Tormenting and killing people.

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:55.510
Whenever these crafty triplets set their mind
to it, their horrifically powerful magic is

00:10:55.510 --> 00:11:00.680
able to cause massive devastation - just like
the prophecy for the fifth bride’s offspring

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:02.100
dictates.

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:05.440
And finally, the sixth child of the Scarlet
King.

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:11.400
The concept associated with this one is “Hidden”,
meaning it can change its face and walk unnoticed

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:12.410
through creation.

00:11:12.410 --> 00:11:17.840
It’s also said to have the responsibility
of opening the ways between worlds, and allowing

00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:20.720
the war to end all wars to first begin.

00:11:20.720 --> 00:11:27.250
There have been a huge number of guesses for
this spot, with some even suggesting SCP-055

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:32.990
- the Anti-Meme - but since we’re having
fun here, we want to make an even wilder suggestion.

00:11:32.990 --> 00:11:39.080
We posit that the sixth child of the Scarlet
King is Alison Chao, also known as L.S. and

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:43.600
The Black Queen, the most powerful member
of the Serpent’s Hand.

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:47.490
We get it, we have a lot of explaining to
do, but hear us out.

00:11:47.490 --> 00:11:51.950
Alison Chao is a member of the Serpent’s
Hand, or technically, many members.

00:11:51.950 --> 00:11:56.870
Multiple versions of her exist across parallel
dimensions in the SCP Multiverse - They’re

00:11:56.870 --> 00:12:00.860
mostly all estranged daughters of Foundation
researcher, Dr. Charles Gears.

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:05.800
This estrangement leads them to collaborate
in the Wanderer’s Library, the secret base

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:10.140
of the Serpent’s Hand, to conduct raids
on the Foundation in revenge.

00:12:10.140 --> 00:12:15.290
But what if the leader of these alternate
Alisons had an ulterior motive, because - in

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:20.490
the infinite number of possibilities offered
by the multiverse - this one was not the daughter

00:12:20.490 --> 00:12:23.470
of Charles Gears, but the Scarlet King.

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:28.010
She’s merely using the pain of her counterparts
to manipulate them into accomplishing her

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:31.900
true father’s goal: Undermining the SCP
Foundation.

00:12:31.900 --> 00:12:37.540
Let’s break it down: The “Hidden” child
is prophesied to walk unnoticed through creation.

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:43.320
Not only does Alison Chao appear human, the
use of SCP-268 - a newsboy cap that causes

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:47.790
the wearer to become unnoticed - allows her
to walk anywhere throughout creation without

00:12:47.790 --> 00:12:48.790
being detected.

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:53.760
But most importantly of all, the Hidden child
is said to be the one who opens the way for

00:12:53.760 --> 00:12:56.920
the Scarlet King’s entrance into our dimension.

00:12:56.920 --> 00:13:02.600
And Alison Chao has access to the Wanderer’s
Library: An unfettered access point between

00:13:02.600 --> 00:13:03.910
dimensions.

00:13:03.910 --> 00:13:08.920
If one of the infinite Alisons was the secret
daughter of the Scarlet King, would the Wanderer’s

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:14.220
Library not be a perfect way for him to leave
his own dimension and enter ours?

00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:19.920
She could be the final piece he needs, Hidden
under the nose of the Foundation and the Serpent’s

00:13:19.920 --> 00:13:24.480
Hand, making all the secret power plays to
allow for the Scarlet King’s eventual bloody

00:13:24.480 --> 00:13:26.570
revenge on our world.

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:33.400
Unless, of course, SCP-999 - the family disappointment
- stops him first.

00:13:33.400 --> 00:13:37.300
We realize that some of these theories may
seem surprising, but when it comes to the

00:13:37.300 --> 00:13:43.680
anomalous - especially the Scarlet King - the
only thing you can ever expect is the unexpected.

00:13:43.680 --> 00:13:45.230
Do you agree with our theories?

00:13:45.230 --> 00:13:48.540
If not, who do you think are the children
of the Scarlet King?

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:50.400
Let us know down in the comments.

00:13:50.400 --> 00:13:55.350
One thing is for certain: We hope we never
meet any of this terrible tyrant’s nasty

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:56.350
children.

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:58.150
Except the Tickle Monster, of course.

00:13:58.150 --> 00:13:59.970
He can hang with us any time.

00:13:59.970 --> 00:14:05.941
Now check out “SCP-001 - The Scarlet King”
and “SCP-999 - The Tickle Monster” for

00:14:05.941 --> 00:14:12.329
more information about the Scarlet King and
his misfit Children.

